      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I disagree on the text chat feature as it will discourage users from interacting socially with voice and encourage mutes. While there is nothing wrong with mutes its not exactly the best experience for a social platform. Text chat would also be very intrusive and annoying for vr users where it be a hand trigger for a text menu or displayed on the screen.\n\nMessages in vrchat would be handy. With limits like 150characters as I would not like to receive spam and also make an option for friends only to send messages. I like this idea incase I am in a private world or editing worlds and people request on me when I am busy so they dont think I am ignoring them.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
